    prompt: "DFS follows one path as far as it goes before backing up. Without visited state it would loop forever on any cycle.\n\nIn a **directed** graph, return the sorted list of vertices reachable from `start`, including `start` itself.\n\n`(3, [(0, 1), (1, 0)], 0)` gives `[0, 1]` — the cycle must not hang.",
