    prompt: "Union-Find answers *are these in the same group?* by giving every group one **representative**. Find walks up to it; union links one representative under another; path compression flattens the walk for next time.\n\nApply each `(a, b)` union in order and return the number of groups that remain. Every vertex starts in its own group.\n\n`(4, [(0, 1), (2, 3), (0, 2)])` leaves `1`.",
    exportName: "count_groups",
    scaffolds: { L1: "def count_groups(vertex_count, unions):\n    pass", L2: "def count_groups(vertex_count, unions):\n    pass", L3: "def count_groups(vertex_count, unions):\n    pass", L4: "" },
