    prompt: "Broadcasting compares shapes **right to left**. Two axes are compatible when they are equal or one of them is `1`; a missing axis counts as `1`. The result takes the larger of each pair.\n\nReturn the broadcast result shape of tuples `a` and `b`, or `None` when they are incompatible.\n\n`(3, 1)` with `(4,)` gives `(3, 4)`. `(3,)` with `(4,)` is incompatible.",
    exportName: "broadcast_shape",
    scaffolds: { L1: "def broadcast_shape(a, b):\n    pass", L2: "def broadcast_shape(a, b):\n    pass", L3: "def broadcast_shape(a, b):\n    pass", L4: "" },
