    solution: "def bagged_predictions(predictions):\n    if not predictions:\n        return None\n    width = len(predictions[0])\n    if any(len(row) != width for row in predictions):\n        return None\n    count = len(predictions)\n    return [sum(row[i] for row in predictions) / count for i in range(width)]",
