    estimatedMinutes: 14,
    prompt: "A random split assumes independent rows. When several rows share a group, or when time orders them, that assumption fails and the score inflates.\n\nReturn `True` if a split is valid. `groups[i]` is the row's group and `times[i]` its timestamp. A split is valid when **no group** appears on both sides and **every** training time is at most the smallest test time.\n\nAn empty test or train side is trivially valid.",
