    prompt: "You may buy and sell one share any number of times, but after **any sale** you must sit out the very next day. Return the largest total profit from `prices`.\n\nPosition alone cannot answer what is legal here, because the rules depend on whether you hold a share and whether yesterday was a sale. Three running values are enough: holding, just sold, and free to act.\n\nAn empty or single-day list yields zero.",
