    solution: "def count_change(coins, target):\n    combos = [0] * (target + 1)\n    combos[0] = 1\n    for coin in coins:\n        for amount in range(coin, target + 1):\n            combos[amount] += combos[amount - coin]\n    perms = [0] * (target + 1)\n    perms[0] = 1\n    for amount in range(1, target + 1):\n        for coin in coins:\n            if coin <= amount:\n                perms[amount] += perms[amount - coin]\n    return (combos[target], perms[target])",
