    prompt: "Compare one large filter against a stack of `3 by 3` filters covering the same reach.\n\nA filter of side `f` reaching `f` positions is matched by `(f - 1) // 2` filters of side three. Return `(large, stacked, ratio)`, where each count is `side * side * channels * channels` per layer and `ratio` is `stacked / large` rounded to three places.\n\nRaise `ValueError` when `f` is even or below three.",
