    prompt: "Every value in `values` appears exactly twice except **two** of them. Return those two, sorted.\n\nCombining everything with exclusive-or cancels the pairs and leaves the two unique values combined. That result cannot be zero, since they differ, so any set bit of it marks a position where they disagree.\n\nSplit the list on that bit and each group reduces to the single-value problem. Raise `ValueError` unless exactly two values are unpaired.",
    exportName: "two_singles",
    scaffolds: { L1: "def two_singles(values):\n    pass", L2: "def two_singles(values):\n    pass", L3: "def two_singles(values):\n    pass", L4: "" },
